@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title UC01 — Search related materials
actor Teacher
participant "Catalog / picker" as UI
participant catalog as Catalog
participant material_source as Source
Teacher -> UI : Set filters
UI -> Catalog : search(target, profile, filters, after)
loop current candidate occurrences
  Catalog -> Source : resolve(locator, target, profile)
  Source --> Catalog : Permitted native origin or refusal
end
Catalog --> UI : Content groups / origins / cursor
UI --> Teacher : Display authorized results
@enduml
